@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title Practice and participation | proposed rules, not worship measurement
class Learner {
  learnerId
}
class RememberingMoment {
  momentId
  approvedContextId
}
class PracticePlan {
  planId
  approvedPracticeId
  timezone
  suggestedWindowDays
}
class PracticeCheckIn {
  localDate
  participationState
  idempotencyKey
}
class RewardGrant {
  eligibleEventId
  rewardRuleId
  participationXP
}
class UnlockRecord {
  stageId
  sourceLearningCompletionId
}
class ReflectionPrompt {
  contentKey
  enabledInputMode
}
Learner "1" -- "0..*" RememberingMoment
Learner "1" -- "0..*" PracticePlan
RememberingMoment "1" <-- "0..*" PracticePlan
PracticePlan "1" *-- "0..*" PracticeCheckIn
Learner "1" -- "0..*" RewardGrant
Learner "1" -- "0..*" UnlockRecord
PracticePlan ..> ReflectionPrompt : optional closing invitation
note bottom of PracticeCheckIn
Unique per plan and local date.
Missing day is a pause, not loss of learning.
Seven-day gate is not approved.
end note
note bottom of RewardGrant
Once per learner / eligible reward event.
No emotion, worship-count, or faith score.
Exact values remain a product decision.
end note
note bottom of ReflectionPrompt
Text / voice selection and storage are pending.
Raw responses are not progress or reward payloads.
end note
@enduml
